<header><p class="st-kicker">city state · Iberia</p><h1 class="st-title">Canton of Cartagena</h1><p class="st-meta">1873 CE – 1874 CE · capital Cartagena</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The most durable of the 1873 Spanish cantons, which seized the navy's main base and held out for six months against the Republic.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>On 12 July 1873 intransigent federalists led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/antonio-galvez-arce">Antonio Gálvez Arce</a>, known as Antoñete, proclaimed the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guangzhou">Canton</a> of Cartagena. They seized the naval arsenal and much of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mediterranean">Mediterranean</a> fleet, and a revolutionary junta called on other cities to join a Cantonal Federation.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The canton issued its own coins and newspaper and used the fleet, commanded by General <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/juan-contreras-y-roman">Juan Contreras</a>, to raid <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alicante">Alicante</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/almeria">Almería</a> and other ports for supplies. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/madrid">Madrid</a> government declared its ships <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/piracy">pirates</a>, and foreign warships seized some of them. Its leaders saw it as the seed of a federal <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a>.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>Government forces besieged Cartagena from the autumn of 1873. Weakened by bombardment and the explosion of its arsenal, it surrendered on 12 January 1874, and many leaders escaped to <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/french-algeria">French Algeria</a>. The rebellion helped discredit the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/spanish-first-republic">Spanish First Republic</a>.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/canton-of-cartagena.jpg" alt="Canton of Cartagena" width="320" height="213"><figcaption>Image: Wikimedia Commons · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bahnmarke_bleibt_an_Backbord_liegen.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>1